[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6961.589, "timestamp": "01:56:01", "text": "是的，我们当时根本没玩那个游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6964.95, "timestamp": "01:56:04", "text": "是啊，真的很有趣。我很喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6967.669, "timestamp": "01:56:07", "text": "是的。我希望我们能在以下方面进行更多合作："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6969.83, "timestamp": "01:56:09", "text": "未来，当我在的时候，哦，是的。兄弟，就这么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6973.03, "timestamp": "01:56:13", "text": "问问吧，兄弟。是的。是的。是的。说实话，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6974.39, "timestamp": "01:56:14", "text": "或许应该多问问其他人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6975.51, "timestamp": "01:56:15", "text": "事情是这样的，对吧？我一直"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6977.35, "timestamp": "01:56:17", "text": "现在对谁都太被动了。我应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6978.55, "timestamp": "01:56:18", "text": "可能会开始变得更加活跃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6980.87, "timestamp": "01:56:20", "text": "直接问别人就行了。看起来很有趣。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6982.229, "timestamp": "01:56:22", "text": "以后应该多这样做。现在，你呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6985.03, "timestamp": "01:56:25", "text": "问问可以吗？比如，如果他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6987.43, "timestamp": "01:56:27", "text": "如果他们拒绝怎么办？那么，就这样吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6989.109, "timestamp": "01:56:29", "text": "它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6990.55, "timestamp": "01:56:30", "text": "如果他们拒绝，那就这样吧。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6992.79, "timestamp": "01:56:32", "text": "我没意见。说实话，如果他们不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6994.709, "timestamp": "01:56:34", "text": "公平地说，我喜欢我的内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6997.75, "timestamp": "01:56:37", "text": "好的。我已经开始放弃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7000.39, "timestamp": "01:56:40", "text": "我感觉自己可能在打扰别人。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7002.39, "timestamp": "01:56:42", "text": "我已经很麻烦了。我已经接受了这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7009.669, "timestamp": "01:56:49", "text": "不过，谢谢你，Jockey。聊得不错"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7011.35, "timestamp": "01:56:51", "text": "又见面了，兄弟。爱它。就是它"